                                      2 ; Special Function Registers
                                      3 ; Special Function Register Map and Defines
                                      4 ;
                                      5 ; Verification Date: 2026-08-12 - reviewed for errors, matches documentation 
                                      6 ; STC15W408AS-STC15F2K60S2-en.pdf Update Date: 2015/10/10
